{'symbol': 'NXPI', 'date': '2022-11-29 19:13:00', 'title': 'NXP FOUNDATION COMMITS $250,000 TO ADVANCE ENGINEERING EDUCATION AT AUSTIN COMMUNITY COLLEGE DISTRICT', 'text': "AUSTIN, TEXAS, NOV. 29, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- THE NXP FOUNDATION, THE NONPROFIT ORGANIZATION ASSOCIATED WITH NXP SEMICONDUCTORS (NASDAQ:NXPI), TODAY ANNOUNCED A $250,000 DONATION TO THE AUSTIN COMMUNITY COLLEGE DISTRICT (ACC) FOUNDATION IN SUPPORT OF THE SCHOOL'S ENGINEERING TECHNOLOGY AND ADVANCED MANUFACTURING PROGRAM. REPRESENTATIVES FROM THE NXP FOUNDATION PRESENTED A CHECK TO THE ACC BOARD OF TRUSTEES AT A RECEPTION ON TUESDAY, NOVEMBER 29, 2022."}